      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: The header comment notes that promise (1) verifies that the hermetic toolchain Node is used rather than a system `node`, but `major \u003e\u003d 20` will also pass on any modern system `node` (and if Node predated `node:test`, line 15\u0027s `require(\u0027node:test\u0027)` would throw before this callback runs). Asserting on `process.execPath` (e.g. that it resolves under the Bazel runfiles/execroot tree) would directly pin the hermetic toolchain resolution.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 9999
      },
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "5493f7a244b6edd6da0a58ae346bd39ebc40fd3f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
