      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T22:41:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider adding `allow_empty \u003d False` here. In Starlark, `mandatory \u003d True` on `attr.label_list` only requires the attribute to be specified, not non-empty (`srcs \u003d []` is still permitted). Because `node --test` with no file arguments falls back to recursively scanning the working directory (the Bazel runfiles tree) for matching test files, `allow_empty \u003d False` prevents accidentally running unintended files if `srcs \u003d []` is passed.",
